OL,3,AI had to explain to my teacher what a
OL,4,Ayoung carer was - we need more support
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeraya is only 15 but cannot remember a
OL,7,Ftime when she was not a carer for her
OL,8,Ftwo sisters.
OL,10,FShe is among the young carers crying
OL,11,Fout for what they have called crucial
OL,12,Fsupport, with Neraya saying she has
OL,13,Feven had to explain what she does to
OL,14,Fher teachers.
OL,16,FOn Monday, the Welsh government will
OL,17,Fpublish a national strategy for unpaid
OL,18,Fcarers, which will have seven
OL,19,Fpriorities including earlier
OL,20,Frecognition and mental health support.
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
