OL,3,AI had to explain to my teacher what a
OL,4,Ayoung carer was - we need more support
OL,5,
OL,6,FNeraya, from Bridgend, said people in
OL,7,Fher position wanted the chance of "a
OL,8,Fchildhood of our own".
